text_output=So it is absolutely our initial target for everything on agentic. We'll be starting with community frameworks, open vino, really just to optimize where that's not possible within those frameworks today. Memory constraints, maybe it's something trying to use multiple IPs on the platform. You know that's where open vino would have a play here.
